OL,3,GNEWSARacist graffiti at nature spot
OL,4,A'won't be tolerated'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRacist graffiti spray-painted
OL,7,Frepeatedly at the entrance of a popular
OL,8,Fnature reserve has left nearby
OL,9,Fresidents "shocked and deeply
OL,10,Fsaddened".
OL,12,FIt is the third time an offensive slur
OL,13,Fhas been reported on a stone marker at
OL,14,Fthe entrance to Magpie Bottom Nature
OL,15,FReserve in Hanham on the outskirts of
OL,16,FBristol - twice in one week in August
OL,17,Fand once in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
