OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1787306151
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSARacist graffiti at nature spot
OL,4,A'won't be tolerated'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe graffiti has been removed by South
OL,7,FGloucestershire Council, which owns the
OL,8,Fpark, with councillor John Bradbury
OL,9,Fsaying the "unacceptable" vandalism
OL,10,F"will not be tolerated".
OL,12,FOne resident, who asked to remain
OL,13,Fanonymous, said they had been left
OL,14,F"shocked and deeply saddened" by the
OL,15,Fincidents.
